{"availability":"available","full":"camel-ai/multi-agent-streamlit-ui","name":"multi-agent-streamlit-ui","description":"CAMEL framework-based multi-agent system for task-driven and dynamic environments","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":112,"forks":28,"created":"2023-12-10T15:23:20Z","updated":"2024-05-21T20:00:18Z","branch":"feature/multi-agent","homepage":"https://camel-ai.github.io/multi-agent-streamlit-ui/","topics":["camel","large-language-models","multi-agent","streamlit"],"demo":"https://camel-ai.github.io/multi-agent-streamlit-ui/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:22:43.791Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:22:43.791Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:22:43.791Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:50.966Z","stars":112,"forks":28},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:22:43.791Z","stars":112,"forks":28}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This project, part of CAMEL, implements a multi-agent system with a user interface developed in Streamlit. It showcases the integration of advanced agent-based modeling techniques with an accessible and interactive web interface.","In an era where digital interfaces are integral to our daily lives, the need for seamless and meaningful human-computer interactions has never been greater. This is where the groundbreaking the Multi-Agent System comes into play, introducing a game-changer in the realm of digital communication. You can find more design concepts of the system here: design docs","The Multi-Agent System has risen as a critical solution to complex and dynamic problems in computational intelligence. CAMEL.AI, an acronym for Communicative Agents for “Mind” Exploration of Large-Scale Language Model Society, is an outstanding open-source community that aims to refine how AI agents interact within an AI system. The Multi-Agent System, proposed by CAMEL.AI, endeavors to meet the nuanced requirements and expectations of users and enterprises, whi